## 3. Kafka Setup

```
Topics created (one per source table):
  prod_mysql.ecommerce.orders    → 8 partitions (high volume)
  prod_mysql.ecommerce.users     → 4 partitions
  prod_mysql.ecommerce.products  → 2 partitions (low volume)

Kafka topic config:
  retention.ms        = 604800000     // 7 days retention
  retention.bytes     = 107374182400  // 100GB max per topic
  cleanup.policy      = delete        // Not compacted (DLT handles dedup)
  replication.factor  = 3             // HA across 3 Kafka brokers
```

**Why not use Kafka log compaction?**  
Log compaction keeps only the latest value per key — but we need ALL change events in Bronze (for audit trail). DLT Silver handles the "latest state" materialisation.

