### 12.5 Layer 5 — Heartbeat Pattern (End-to-End Liveness Test)

The heartbeat is a **canary record** that flows through the entire pipeline every N minutes.  
If the heartbeat stops arriving at Silver within the expected window → the pipeline is stalled.

```
             Every 5 minutes:
MySQL ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────►
  INSERT INTO heartbeat (id, pulse_ts)
  VALUES (1, NOW())
  ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE pulse_ts = NOW();
        │
        ▼ (Debezium captures the UPDATE)
Kafka ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────►
  prod_mysql.ecommerce.heartbeat topic
  message: {"op":"u", "after": {"id":1, "pulse_ts": 1716912300000}}
        │
        ▼ (DLT Bronze → Silver)
Silver heartbeat table ────────────────────────────────────────►
  SELECT MAX(pulse_ts) FROM silver_heartbeat
  → If MAX(pulse_ts) < NOW() - 5 minutes → ALERT: pipeline is stalled
```

