### 12.7 Complete Alert Runbook

| Alert | Meaning | Immediate Action | Root Cause Checklist |
|---|---|---|---|
| Debezium connector FAILED | Connector crashed | Auto-restart via REST API | 1. Check error trace 2. Binlog expired? 3. MySQL network? |
| Binlog gap > 6 days | Risk of offset expiry | Increase MySQL retention immediately | Set expire_logs_days = 14 |
| Kafka lag > 5,000 | DLT is behind | Check DLT pipeline state | 1. DLT running? 2. Kafka backpressure? 3. Compute scale-up? |
| No Kafka messages for 10 min | Debezium stopped producing | Check Debezium connector status | 1. MySQL activity idle? 2. Connector FAILED? |
| DLT batch gap > 3 min | DLT stalled | Check pipeline UI for errors | 1. Cluster crashed? 2. Kafka unreachable? 3. OOM? |
| Heartbeat > 3 min old | Full pipeline stall | Page on-call engineer | Work through layers 1→5 in order |
| Reconciliation diff > 100 | Missing records | Do not restart blindly | 1. Check quarantine table 2. Check Bronze count vs Silver 3. Check sequence_by collisions |
| DLT expectation failure > 1% | Schema change or bad data | Check quarantine table | 1. New MySQL column? 2. Data type change? 3. Null constraint violation? |

